        </div>
       <p class="mt-8 text-pretty text-lg font-medium text-gray-500 sm:text-xl/8">Browse <span class="font-bold">GitLocker's</span> selection of <span class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-semibold text-2xl px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded dark:bg-blue-200 dark:text-blue-800"><%= number_with_delimiter(Product.count, :delimiter => ',') %></span> free and premium code for websites, apps, games, plugins, themes, snippets, and packages from our <span class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-semibold text-2xl px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded dark:bg-blue-200 dark:text-blue-800"><%= User.count %></span> users or sign up to start <span class="font-bold">buying and selling</span>!</p>
